# Today: status card, pill pack card, blocking card, then the real
# mark-taken path (floating CTA -> Shake to Confirm -> its tap fallback),
# proving the taken state and undoing it.
#
# `fresh` (not `launch`) so PillStore seeds a brand-new pack: packNumber 1,
# .twentyOneSeven, day 1, nothing taken yet (PillStore.swift:1205-1223). That
# guarantees a due, untaken pill regardless of what a previous flow left on
# the pack. /plus-home only flips onboarding-complete + Plus; it never
# touches the pack (PillieApp.swift:665-670).
fresh
launch
wait text "Get started" 15
openurl "pillie://debug/plus-home?lang=en"
wait text "Today" 15
shot today-home

# Blocking is never configured on a fresh install (no FamilyControls
# selection), so the enable-later card always renders here.
# BlockingStatusCard.swift:57; CTA text "Set up app blocking":
# Localizable.xcstrings:105604 today.protection.setup.cta.
wait id homeBlockingStatusCard 10
shot today-blocking-card

# PillPackCard.swift:33-34,66; Localizable.xcstrings:64629 today.pack.title
# = "This cycle".
wait text "This cycle" 10
shot today-pill-pack-card

# Due-action CTA label. DueActionCopy.swift:6-7 today.action.take_pill;
# Localizable.xcstrings:100654, value "Take pill". The identical string also
# renders as the (non-interactive) StatusCard subtitle at the same time
# (StatusCardTitle.swift:42-43) — only the floating Button answers hit
# testing, the same shape already proven for the Today/History/Settings tab
# labels in smoke.flow, so `tap --label` still resolves to the CTA.
# A new install's default pack lands on its break day (Day 28 of 28, nothing
# due). Pin the clock and seed a pack whose today is due (DebugQA.swift
# missedRecentDays; proven in history-correction.flow).
# Plus users confirm with a shake (HomeView.swift: Plus && !reduceMotion); a
# free user logs on tap. fresh resets the keychain trial, so grant one.
openurl pillie://debug/trial-grant?lang=en
openurl pillie://debug/fixed-now?at=2026-09-15T15:00:00Z
tap --id developerMenuAvatarButton
wait text "PACK & CALENDAR" 10
tap --label "Missed the last 2 days"  # row id leaks onto its children (DeveloperMenuView.swift:114)
wait text "Take pill" 10
shot today-status-due
tap --label "Take pill"

# Plus (from /plus-home) requires shake confirm: HomeView.swift:299 (Plus &&
# !reduceMotion) -> ShakeConfirmView. Headline "Shake to Confirm":
# ShakeConfirmView.swift:90; Localizable.xcstrings:62704 today.action.shake.
wait text "Shake to Confirm" 10
shot today-shake-confirm

# Simulator cannot shake the device — use the accessibility fallback.
# ShakeConfirmView.swift:169 shakeTapToConfirmFallback; label "Tap to
# Confirm Instead": Localizable.xcstrings:62979 today.action.tap_instead.
tap --id shakeTapToConfirmFallback

# Completion runs a ~1.2s celebration before dismissing
# (ShakeConfirmView.swift:220-237), then the floating CTA becomes the undo
# control. TodayActionState.swift:45-46 today.action.undo_complete;
# Localizable.xcstrings:61329, value "That's logged. Tap to undo."
wait text "That's logged. Tap to undo." 15
shot today-taken

# Undo path: HomeView.swift:689-698 calls store.unmarkTodayAsTaken().
tap --label "That's logged. Tap to undo."
wait text "Take pill" 10
shot today-undone
